+  "answer": "[MODELLED CHARGE -- superseded, see THE_M2_NUMBERS_HERE_ARE_A_MODEL_SUPERSEDED_BY] The modelled optimism over 44 matched live cells is 0.036903 at the median and 0.166068 at most, against the published 0.046236 / 0.168048. The published figure was too PESSIMISTIC because it charged the run's opening RESET, which the installed gateway gives away free. The correction is still non-zero on 38 of 44 cells, so the defect is real; it is simply smaller than reported.",
